# QR & Barcode Generator

A simple, responsive web application for generating **QR codes and barcodes** directly in the browser.

Users can enter URLs, text, numbers, or alphanumeric values and instantly generate a downloadable QR code or barcode.

## Features

* Generate QR codes from:

  * URLs
  * Text
  * Numbers
  * Alphanumeric values
* Generate CODE128 barcodes
* Live preview while typing
* Download generated QR codes as PNG
* Download generated barcodes as SVG
* Responsive design for desktop, tablet, and mobile devices
* Separate pages for QR code and barcode generation
* Client-side generation — no backend required
* Smooth UI animations with Framer Motion
* Reusable Navbar and Footer components

## Technologies

### Frontend

* React
* JavaScript (ES6+)
* SCSS
* React Router
* Framer Motion

### Libraries

* [QRCode](https://www.npmjs.com/package/qrcode) — QR code generation
* [JsBarcode](https://www.npmjs.com/package/jsbarcode) — barcode generation
* [React Router](https://reactrouter.com/) — client-side routing
* [Framer Motion](https://www.framer.com/motion/) — UI animations

### Development & Deployment

* Vite
* npm
* Git & GitHub
* Vercel

## How It Works

The application provides two generators:

### QR Code Generator

Enter any text, number, URL, or other supported string.

Examples:

```text
https://example.com
```

```text
Hello World
```

```text
123456789
```

```text
PRODUCT-2026-001
```

The application generates the QR code directly in the browser using the `qrcode` library.

### Barcode Generator

The barcode generator uses the **CODE128** format, which supports both numbers and letters.

Examples:

```text
123456789
```

```text
ABC123
```

```text
PRODUCT-001
```

```text
INV-2026-08
```

The generated barcode can then be downloaded as an SVG file.

